@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT domain

-- g2-exemption.l4: section 7 of the Regulation of Engagement in Work on Refrigeration or Air-Conditioning Systems Law
-- 5785-2025, exemption from training.  Imports prelude, daydate and domain only.
--
-- WHAT IS ENCODED.  s 7(a) and (b) are powers of the Director of the Training Division: to exempt the holder of a valid
-- electrician licence from the electricity chapter of the studies, and the holder of a valid working-at-height approval from
-- the working-at-height chapter, "within the training under s 6(a)(4)".  Each is a regulative MAY rule typed by the role that
-- acts and what is done; the condition is a fact about the applicant (a flag on the `Applicant` record of domain.l4: the
-- text of the Electricity (Licences) Regulations 7(1)-(7) and of the Work at Height Regulations 5 and 6 is outside this
-- encoding, and what they decide arrives as that flag).  s 7(c) is a duty of the same Director: to publish on the Ministry's
-- website instructions for applying for an exemption and the documents to attach.
--
-- WHAT IS NOT DECIDED HERE.  Whether the Director grants an exemption is the Director's discretion (the Law's "may", MAY in this encoding): it is an
-- input, the fact that an exemption was given (`the electricity chapter exemption was given`).  The text gives no number of
-- hours for a chapter, so an exemption does not change the ceiling on the course in the Second Schedule; what an exemption
-- changes is stated as the chapters the training need not cover (FRAGMENT section 8).  s 7 states no deadline for any act.
--
-- FORKS.  No reading is open in this section beyond those stated: the powers are discretionary (a MAY, whose unexercised
-- omission is benign), the duty of (c) has no WITHIN (the text states no period, and none is invented), and the exemption
-- is given "within the framework of training as stated in s 6(a)(4)": whether an exemption is available to an applicant
-- whose requirement under the Second Schedule involves no training at all is not stated, and is not decided here.

§ `Section 7 — exemption from training`

@desc The acts of the Director of the Training Division under section 7
DECLARE `An act under section 7` IS ONE OF
    `exempt from the electricity chapter of the training`
    `exempt from the working-at-height chapter of the training`
    `publish the instructions for applying for an exemption`

@desc The two chapters of the training that s 7 allows an exemption from
DECLARE `Chapter of the training under section 7` IS ONE OF
    `the electricity chapter`
    `the working-at-height chapter`

-- s 7(a): "The Director of the Training Division may give a holder of a valid electrician licence an exemption from the
-- studies of the electricity chapter within the framework of a training as stated in s 6(a)(4); for this purpose, 'holder of
-- an electrician licence' means the holder of a licence listed in paragraphs (1) to (7) of regulation 7 of the Electricity
-- (Licences) Regulations 5745-1985."
-- src:95 | {{ח:תת|(א)}} מנהל האגף להכשרה מקצועית רשאי לתת לבעל רישיון חשמל בתוקף, פטור מלימודי פרק החשמל במסגרת הכשרה כאמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|בסעיף 6(א)(4)}}; לעניין זה, ”בעל רישיון חשמל“ – בעל רישיון המנוי {{ח:חיצוני|תקנות החשמל (רישיונות)#סעיף 7|בפסקאות (1) עד (7) לתקנה 7 בתקנות החשמל (רישיונות), התשמ״ה–1985}}.
@ref s 7(a): the holder of a valid electrician licence (src:95)
GIVEN applicant IS AN Applicant
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(a) — the applicant holds a valid electrician licence of a listed kind` applicant MEANS
    applicant's `holds a valid electrician licence of a kind listed in the Electricity Regulations`

@ref s 7(a): the Director of the Training Division may exempt the holder from the electricity chapter (src:95)
GIVEN applicant IS AN Applicant
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 7`
`s 7(a) — the Director may exempt the applicant from the electricity chapter of the training` applicant MEANS
    IF   `s 7(a) — the applicant holds a valid electrician licence of a listed kind` applicant
    THEN PARTY `the Director of the Training Division`
         MAY `exempt from the electricity chapter of the training`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- s 7(b): the same for the holder of a valid approval that they were instructed in working at height under regulations 5 and
-- 6 of the Work at Height Regulations 5767-2007, and the working-at-height chapter.
-- src:96 | {{ח:תת|(ב)}} מנהל האגף להכשרה מקצועית רשאי לתת לבעל אישור עבודה בגובה בתוקף, פטור מלימודי פרק עבודה בגובה במסגרת הכשרה כאמור {{ח:פנימי|סעיף 6|בסעיף 6(א)(4)}}; לעניין זה, ”בעל אישור עבודה בגובה“ – בעל אישור המעיד כי קיבל הדרכה בעבודה בגובה כאמור {{ח:חיצוני|תקנות הבטיחות בעבודה (עבודה בגובה)#סעיף 5|בתקנות 5}} {{ח:חיצוני|תקנות הבטיחות בעבודה (עבודה בגובה)#סעיף 6|ו־6 לתקנות הבטיחות בעבודה (עבודה בגובה), התשס״ז–2007}}.
@ref s 7(b): the holder of a valid working-at-height approval (src:96)
GIVEN applicant IS AN Applicant
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 7(b) — the applicant holds a valid working-at-height approval` applicant MEANS
    applicant's `holds a valid working-at-height approval`

@ref s 7(b): the Director of the Training Division may exempt the holder from the working-at-height chapter (src:96)
GIVEN applicant IS AN Applicant
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 7`
`s 7(b) — the Director may exempt the applicant from the working-at-height chapter of the training` applicant MEANS
    IF   `s 7(b) — the applicant holds a valid working-at-height approval` applicant
    THEN PARTY `the Director of the Training Division`
         MAY `exempt from the working-at-height chapter of the training`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- What an exemption that was GIVEN covers: a chapter is covered where the Director gave the exemption and the applicant is
-- one to whom s 7 allows it.  (The Director's grant is a fact about the case.)
@ref s 7(a) and (b)
GIVEN applicant IS AN Applicant
      `the electricity chapter exemption was given` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the working-at-height chapter exemption was given` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `Chapter of the training under section 7`
`s 7 — the chapters of the training the applicant is exempt from` applicant `the electricity chapter exemption was given` `the working-at-height chapter exemption was given` MEANS
    append
        (IF   `the electricity chapter exemption was given` AND `s 7(a) — the applicant holds a valid electrician licence of a listed kind` applicant
         THEN LIST `the electricity chapter`
         ELSE EMPTY)
        (IF   `the working-at-height chapter exemption was given` AND `s 7(b) — the applicant holds a valid working-at-height approval` applicant
         THEN LIST `the working-at-height chapter`
         ELSE EMPTY)

-- s 7(c): "The Director of the Training Division shall publish on the Ministry's website instructions as to how to submit the
-- application for an exemption under this section, and the documents to attach to it."  A duty with no period stated.
-- src:97 | {{ח:תת|(ג)}} מנהל האגף להכשרה מקצועית יפרסם באתר האינטרנט של המשרד הוראות בדבר אופן הגשת הבקשה לפטור לפי סעיף זה, והמסמכים שיש לצרף לה.
@ref s 7(c): the Director of the Training Division must publish the instructions on the Ministry's website (src:97)
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `An act under section 7`
`s 7(c) — the Director must publish the instructions for applying for an exemption` MEANS
    PARTY `the Director of the Training Division`
    MUST  `publish the instructions for applying for an exemption`
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  BREACH BY `the Director of the Training Division`
          BECAUSE "s 7(c): the instructions for applying for an exemption, and the documents to attach, were not published on the Ministry's website"
